Package: network-manager-openvpn3
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 network-manager (>= 1.30),
 openvpn3 | openvpn3-client,
 dbus-system-bus-common,
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for OpenVPN 3 — service
 nm-openvpn3 is a NetworkManager VPN service plugin that drives the
 OpenVPN 3 Linux session manager over D-Bus, written in Rust on top
 of zbus and tokio.
 .
 This package contains the service daemon, the external-UI-mode
 auth-dialog binary, and the NetworkManager .name discovery file —
 enough to configure and bring up openvpn3 connections via nmcli
 without any GUI.

Package: network-manager-openvpn3-gnome
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 network-manager-openvpn3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.10),
 libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.4),
Recommends: network-manager-gnome
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for OpenVPN 3 — GNOME UI
 GUI integration for nm-openvpn3: the libnm-vpn-plugin discovery hook
 plus the GTK4 / libadwaita property editor that gnome-control-center
 and nm-connection-editor load to render OpenVPN 3 connection pages.
 .
 Translations (gettext domain `nm-openvpn3`) and the AppStream
 metainfo file ship here.
